
Getal leare: ['plus:'] betsjut: ['+'].
Getal by: ['+'] dwaan: { :x
	>> koers := 1.
	>> munt := x kwalifikaasje.
	(munt = ['euros']) ja: {
		koers := 2.
	}. <- (sels plus: (x × koers)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars kwalifisearje: ['dollars'].
euros kwalifisearje: ['euros'].
>> jild := dollars + euros.
Utfier skriuwe: jild, nije-rigel.
